---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
  <BaseHead
    title="Journey"
    description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
  />
</head>

<body>

  <Header />

  <main>

    <img
      src="/freedom.png"
      alt="Carmela"
      class="photo"
    />

    <p class="intro">
      Finding a place to belong.
    </p>

<p>
  I’ve recently retired and am excited to begin my next chapter by moving to Malta!
</p>

<p>
  I am actively seeking a clean, modern, and well-maintained 2-bedroom furnished apartment near Sliema, ideally in a residential complex. I will be available for in-person viewings starting November 18th and am ready to move in immediately.
</p>

<p>
  I value walkable, vibrant neighborhoods close to daily conveniences. 
</p>

<p>
  Essential: AC, elevator, easy waste disposal, and nearby grocery shops.<br>
  Desired: A balcony or terrace, and nearby green spaces or parks.
</p>

<p>
Please reach out if you have leads. Thank you!
</p>

    <img
      src="/signatureNEW.png"
      alt="Carmela's signature"
      class="signature"
    />

    <p class="email">
      <a href="mailto:contact@ourmalta.org">
        contact@ourmalta.org
      </a>
    </p>

  </main>

</body>

<style>

main {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
}

p {
  color: #1F3A5F;
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
}

.photo {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 420px;
  height: auto;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
}

.intro {
  color: #1F3A5F;
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.6;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
}

.signature {
  display: block;
  width: 225px;
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  margin-top: 1.1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  margin-left: 0;
}

.email {
  margin: 0;
  color: #1F3A5F;
  font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.email a {
  color: #1F3A5F;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.email a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline;
}

</style>

</html>
